/-!
# Two checked sample transitions of the Lyons plane orbit

These are nodes 1 and 2 of the reproducible `GenerateOrbit.py --limit 3` output.
They exercise the sparse A and packed B checkers on the root plane. The data
agree with the retained 100,000-node tree prefix described in
`../Atlas111PlaneOrbitSource/README.md`. Only kernel reduction checks the edges;
no GAP equality is used as a proof. This module is an optional example consumer.
-/

